multimodalart/higgs-audio-v3-tts-4b-transformers. That repository packages
the bosonai/higgs-audio-v3-tts-4b checkpoint (also published as
bosonai/higgs-tts-3-4b) for Transformers. Those artifacts are Higgs Materials.
