Other software used by this repository
---------------------------------------
These components are not Higgs Materials:

Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct, used to write dialogue text, is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

Training code is adapted from tin-computer/personaplex-finetune (MIT
License) and Kyutai moshi-finetune (Apache License, Version 2.0), and
loads LoRA from Kyutai moshi.

PersonaPlex weights are not included in this repository. Training
downloads them from nvidia/personaplex-7b-v1 under the NVIDIA model
license that accompanies that repository.

